# Launcher Path Resilience Patch

**Goal**: Fix the "Path not found" and "Missing package.json" errors by making the directory switching logic more robust.

## Proposed Changes

### [Sovereign Core Launcher]
#### [MODIFY] [LAUNCH_SOVEREIGN_CORE.bat](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/scripts/launchers/LAUNCH_SOVEREIGN_CORE.bat)
- Replace `cd /d "%~dp0..\.."` with a two-step robust directory change.
- Use a `PROJECT_ROOT` variable to ensure all subsequent `cd` operations are relative to the true root.
- Add checks to verify directory existence before jumping.

```batch
:: Robust Root Detection
set "SCRIPT_DIR=%~dp0"
cd /d "%SCRIPT_DIR%"
cd ..\..
set "PROJECT_ROOT=%CD%"

:: Verification
if not exist "%PROJECT_ROOT%\swarm" (
    echo ❌ ERROR: Could not find project root. Currently at: %CD%
    pause
    exit /b 1
)
```

